  "description": "My mother’s remarriage gave me a younger brother. I happily tried to bond with him; no matter how badly he behaved, I persisted. Will my efforts ever pay off?\n\nAs we grew closer, Millian left to go to war, leaving me with a piece of letter. \n\nIt has been five years since. Millian comes back and I find out that he has been expelled from our family. He is no longer Millian Edmore Rachel, he is now Millian Taylor and he is going to be my husband.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
